00:58:31.140 --> 00:58:53.560
<v Ira Glass>And just one last reminder that we are doing a live show this Friday, coming right up October 9, and we are going to be live streaming this for all of This American Life partners. You have to be a Life Partner to see this that night. I will be telling stories on stage, and then this group of amazing comedians, convened by the very funny Vic Michaelis, are going to improvise scenes based on the stories.
